  "details": "VRChat 2020.2.3p1, build 946\n\n[phenomenon]\n- The world instance has been corrupted.\n- Everyone in the world has been kicked out and cannot rejoin\n- When I entered the broken world, Udon behaved strangely and was kicked out in a few seconds.\n- It's not reproducible.\n\n[World and date of occurrence]\n- wrld_d3a23bd8-fde3-4a38-92a3-3f1d9f61514b\n- 2020.06.25 01:11:50～(JST)\n\n[Situation]\n- There were 11 users in the world.\n- There were a large number of UdonBehaviour objects (about 100 of them).\n　- These objects are SyncPosition\n- All objects were owned by the Master user.\n- When the master tried to re-enter the world in this situation, the instance was corrupted.",
